> cat('\nTreatment is harmful to the heavy and protective to the light, in\n',
+     'exactly offsetting numbers.  S(1) = S(0) implies no treatment effect\n',
+     'on survival in ANY stratum, so the interaction above falsifies it --\n',
+     'while the arm-level survival comparison cannot.\n', sep = '')

Treatment is harmful to the heavy and protective to the light, in
exactly offsetting numbers.  S(1) = S(0) implies no treatment effect
on survival in ANY stratum, so the interaction above falsifies it --
while the arm-level survival comparison cannot.
